    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n55281" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-στίζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>cover with marks</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βιβλία</span> Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.10
			</span></i>; <i>brand</i>, 
